1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,763
Near a point, a curve and its tangent almost agree.

2
00:00:03,763 --> 00:00:06,523
Step dx along the x axis.

3
00:00:06,523 --> 00:00:10,755
The true change in y, along the curve, is delta y.

4
00:00:10,755 --> 00:00:17,200
The change along the tangent, f dash of x times dx, is the differential dy.

5
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,713
The red gap between them is the error.

